      "category": "earthquake_prep",
      "label": "CEA: Earthquake Authority",
      "url": "https://www.earthquakeauthority.com/",
      "text": "Public Meetings\nCEA hosts regularly scheduled public meetings of its Governing Board and Advisory Panel, stakeholder sessions, and other meetings on specific topics.\nPrepare, Survive, & Recover\nYou can’t predict when an earthquake will strike. But you can be prepared for one. Take\nsteps now to prepare—before the next damaging earthquake affects you and your family.",
